        PE inspection found lege-ocr.exe imports VCRUNTIME140.dll and Windows system DLLs. Recursive static-import inspection of the TensorRT worker found nine non-system binaries totaling 424.58 MiB before the 6.0 MiB models and 23.25 MiB Rust CLI; all inspected executables were unsigned.
