record lege-ecosystem.evidence.jbig2-06-cloud-preflight-20261102/1 : evidence {
    title "Cloud preflight on an idle 4-core Xeon VM at a57ee0e: every lib and integration test passes except the six roundtrip_after_fix cases, which spawn an external jbig2dec that is not installed and cannot be built here; the 40-stream original_encode_hashes manifest passes untouched; fmt clean; clippy warnings on arith.rs unchanged at 14 before and after (7 pre-existing unwrap errors in decode test modules); the python feature builds a cp311-abi3 wheel with maturin and its 22 pytest cases pass; cargo package --list shows the python/ metadata, stubs and tests in the tarball. Generic kernel: cached Qe retained with byte-identical output on text29/scan14/noise/checker (wall 0.947/0.945/0.918, instructions 0.945/0.953/1.052/0.901); batched renormalization rejected (instructions up on every input); partial-word zero-context run batching deferred because its 8% instruction saving depends on an inlining decision three near-identical variants lost by 40-50% and dense inputs pay on every pixel. The private corpus and oracle binaries did not transfer; measurements use two public arXiv PDFs rasterized at 300 DPI plus a scan-degraded subset."
    state verified
    result pass
    method command
    observed_at git:a57ee0ec37436781ff40117d4e9cb244600770ee
    command "cargo test --manifest-path lege-codecs/jbig2enc-rust/Cargo.toml --features parallel --lib --tests --no-fail-fast -- --skip grtemplate1_tpgron; cargo fmt --check; cargo clippy --features python,parallel --lib --tests; cargo package --list --allow-dirty; maturin build --release (python/); pytest python/tests"
    artifact "lege-codecs/jbig2enc-rust/docs/benchmarks/2026-11-02-06-cloud/environment.json"
    summary """
        Cloud preflight on an idle 4-core Xeon VM at a57ee0e: every lib and integration test passes except the six roundtrip_after_fix cases, which spawn an external jbig2dec that is not installed and cannot be built here; the 40-stream original_encode_hashes manifest passes untouched; fmt clean; clippy warnings on arith.rs unchanged at 14 before and after (7 pre-existing unwrap errors in decode test modules); the python feature builds a cp311-abi3 wheel with maturin and its 22 pytest cases pass; cargo package --list shows the python/ metadata, stubs and tests in the tarball. Generic kernel: cached Qe retained with byte-identical output on text29/scan14/noise/checker (wall 0.947/0.945/0.918, instructions 0.945/0.953/1.052/0.901); batched renormalization rejected (instructions up on every input); partial-word zero-context run batching deferred because its 8% instruction saving depends on an inlining decision three near-identical variants lost by 40-50% and dense inputs pay on every pixel. The private corpus and oracle binaries did not transfer; measurements use two public arXiv PDFs rasterized at 300 DPI plus a scan-degraded subset.
        """
    author "Claude"
}

